{"version":1,"content":"<p>谷歌周一表示，該公司發現一款能夠在無人類協助的情況下自主識別並利用軟件漏洞的黑客工具，凸顯了人工智能（AI）智能體帶來的風險。谷歌威脅情報小組（Google Threat Intelligence Group，GTIG）在第三季度報告中詳細披露了這一發現。報告稱，該工具位於一台暴露在互聯網上的預發佈伺服器上。攻擊者通常使用此類伺服器存儲和準備攻擊工具。谷歌將這款工具命名為「exploit_agent」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586944.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:04:00.000662+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:51:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.251639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.251639+00:00","content_hash":"4a0e3a428e25b165239505b80e3b8dbcaac18c0648982a4caaac76b10bdaf7cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}